:night
?if actions_left() == 3
  It is full dark, and a thin dry cold is coming up off the river, and the bells of Saint-Paul are ringing for a service that nobody has asked for.
?elif actions_left() == 2
  Midnight has struck at the Arsenal. In the faubourg the shutters are going up, one after another, and behind each of them somebody is counting.
?else
  There is a paleness over the roofs to the east. It will be an hour before it is a color. There is time for one thing more.
?end
